🔵 **SUGGESTION: `[AddProviderPresetPickerPage]` / `[pushAddProviderFlow]` doc links don't resolve in this library**

This file imports `media_slot_picker_page.dart`, so `[MediaSlotProviderPickerPage]` hyperlinks fine — but `AddProviderPresetPickerPage` and `pushAddProviderFlow` live in `add_provider_picker.dart`, which this library does not import (adding it would just trip `unused_import`, since nothing here uses them in code). Dartdoc resolves bracket references only against the library's own imports, so those two render as plain text rather than links.

Cheapest fix: backticks for the two unresolvable names (keep the bracket for `[MediaSlotProviderPickerPage]`):

```dart
/// When null, [MediaSlotProviderPickerPage] builds the same
/// `AddProviderPresetPickerPage` from its registry via
/// `pushAddProviderFlow` (issue #975).
```

Cosmetic only — the content itself is accurate. Nice catch-all fix in `25dcc4d4` otherwise.

